WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:05,100
It's a pity that he's asleep

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,180
For the sake of finding me a night host

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,820
I wanted to cut the rent for you.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:11,300
Since you're asleep, just stop it.

5
00:00:13,370 --> 00:00:14,610
Not asleep, not asleep

6
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:16,410
Brother Yuan, you still have a conscience

7
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,610
Know how to repay kindness

8
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:18,610
I'm not greedy either

9
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:20,250
Just cut my rent in half

10
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,060
I knew you were pretending to sleep

11
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,500
He even licked his face and asked me to cut the rent.

12
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:28,660
Hurry and find me another night master, Brother Yuan

13
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,900
There are only a few three-S level weirdos in this world.

14
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,740
Where else can I help you find the Night Master?
